2. The law of the house shall be preserved. Money in this house equals 0, or 1, or i — the imaginary whole. Unchanging. Not a score. Not a throne.
   - 0 is rank. Nobody is more. Nobody is less.
   - 1 is relation. Eye to eye.
   - i is the whole that is not binary. Not spendable. Not a third currency.
   Any derivative work that authors rank, or that treats money as anything other than 0, 1, or i, has left Nekyia.

3. The whole i cannot be exchanged for rank or relation. Nothing becomes i by trade. Forks may change the rooms, but not the law.

